{"date":"2026-10-10","level":"n4","title":"娘とのトランプ遊び","text":"休みの日、久しぶりに娘とトランプで遊んだ。最初はルールを忘れていて何度も聞き直したが、娘が丁寧に教えてくれたので、だんだん楽しくなってきた。笑ったり悔しがったりしながら何回も勝負しているうちに、気づいたら三時間も経っていた。娘は負けるのが悔しかったようだが、最後は二人とも大笑いした。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"休み","basic_form":"休み","reading":"やすみ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"の","basic_form":"の","reading":"の","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"日","basic_form":"日","reading":"ひ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"久しぶり","basic_form":"久しぶり","reading":"ひさしぶり","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"娘","basic_form":"娘","reading":"むすめ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"と","basic_form":"と","reading":"と","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"トランプ","basic_form":"トランプ","reading":"トランプ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"で","basic_form":"で","reading":"で","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"遊んだ","basic_form":"遊ぶ","reading":"あそんだ","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"最初","basic_form":"最初","reading":"さいしょ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"は","basic_form":"は","reading":"は","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"ルール","basic_form":"ルール","reading":"ルール","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"忘れていて","basic_form":"忘れる","reading":"わすれていて","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"何度","basic_form":"何度","reading":"なんど","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"も","basic_form":"も","reading":"も","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"聞き直した","basic_form":"聞き直す","reading":"ききなおした","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"娘","basic_form":"娘","reading":"むすめ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"丁寧","basic_form":"丁寧","reading":"ていねい","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"教えてくれた","basic_form":"教える","reading":"おしえてくれた","pos"